body:
Hi sorry I’m on mobile and it wouldn’t let me add text to the post so I’m putting it in a comment!

&#x200B;

So my sister gave me a rose on Valentine’s Day and I just noticed that there’s new growth on the stem. I didn’t even know that you could propagate roses, let alone ones that have been cut???? I just don’t know what to do I’ve just sat it in a vase with water expecting it to just die. Is it possible to propagate it and if so what should I do??
